      "type": "Environmental",
      "requirement": "The RW project is a major PSD stationary source for NSR pollutants for which the corresponding onshore area is designated attainment or unclassifiable. This project triggers PSD review because the total emissions for the stationary source (i.e., SFW) prior to the RW project exceeds the PSD major source thresholds.",
      "scope": "RW project within BOEM Lease Area OCS-A 0486; air emissions; preconstruction phase",
